# {{ ctf_config.name }} Challenges

## Difficulty Distribution
| Category | {{ ctf_config.difficulties | map("title") | join(" | ") }} | Total |
|----------|{% for difficulty in ctf_config.difficulties %}:---:|{% endfor %}:---:|
{% for category in ctf_config.categories %}
{{ "| " ~ (category | title) ~ " | " }}
  {%- for difficulty in ctf_config.difficulties %}
{{ distributions[category].get(difficulty, 0) ~ " | " }}
  {%- endfor %}
{{ (distributions[category].values() | sum) ~ " |" }}
{% endfor %}
| **Total** |
{%- for difficulty in ctf_config.difficulties %}
{{ distributions["total"].get(difficulty, 0) ~ " | " }}
{%- endfor %}
{{ (distributions["total"].values() | sum) ~ " |" }}

## Challenges ({{ challenges | count}} total)
{% if challenges | count == 0 %}
None
{% else %}
| Name | Folder | Description | Category | Difficulty | Author |
|------|--------|-------------|----------|------------|--------|
{% for challenge in challenges %}
{{ "| [" ~ (challenge.name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.category.lower() ~ "/" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ ">)"
   ~ " | [" ~ (challenge.folder_name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.category.lower() ~ "/" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ ">)"
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.description | trim | truncate(100))
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.category | title)
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.difficulty | title)
   ~ " | " ~ challenge.author  ~ " |"
}}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Services ({{ services | count }} total)
{% if services | count == 0 %}
None
{% else %}
| Service | Challenge | Category | Ports | Type |
|---------|-----------|----------|-------|------|
{% for service, challenge in services %}
{{ "| [" ~ (service.name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.category.lower() ~ "/" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ service.path.as_posix() ~ ">)"
   ~ " | [" ~ (challenge.name | truncate(30)) ~ "](<./" ~ challenge.category.lower() ~ "/" ~ challenge.folder_name ~ ">)"
   ~ " | " ~ (challenge.category | title)
   ~ " | " ~ (service.ports | join(", "))
   ~ " | " ~ (service.type | title)  ~ " |"
}}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}